{
 "_about": "Plugin catalog for 'live plugins'. Each rule: regex 'match' on 'Vendor / Name' (case-insensitive). First match wins. Fields: category, styles (list), emulates (hardware or concept), notes. Contributions welcome: add the plugins you know.",
